{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"batch","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Batch","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Batch (.bat .cmd).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"batch","name":"Batch","extensions":[".bat",".cmd"],"grammar":"grammars/batch.json","lineComment":"REM"}],"snippets":[{"language":"Batch","path":"snippets/batch.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/batch.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": true,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"REM.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"::.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"%[A-Za-z0-9_~:*]+%|%%?[A-Za-z0-9~]\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\s*:[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"@echo\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:enabledelayedexpansion|errorlevel|setlocal|endlocal|defined|exist|shift|start|call|else|goto|equ|for|geq|gtr|leq|lss|neq|not|set|do|if|in)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:OFF|ON)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:robocopy|findstr|mkdir|rmdir|pause|title|xcopy|where|echo|copy|move|type|exit|dir|del|cls|ren|cd)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/batch.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Header\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bat\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@echo off\",\n      \"setlocal\",\n      \"\",\n      \"$0\",\n      \"\",\n      \"endlocal\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A script header\"\n  },\n  \"If exist\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ife\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"if exist \\\"${1:path}\\\" (\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \")\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"if exist\"\n  },\n  \"For loop\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"for\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"for /f \\\"tokens=*\\\" %%a in (${1:file}) do (\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \")\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"for /f\"\n  },\n  \"Label\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"lbl\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \":${1:label}\",\n      \"$0\",\n      \"goto :eof\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A label\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Batch\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Batch.\n\n## Files\n\n`.bat`, `.cmd`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `REM`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `bat` | A script header |\n| `ife` | if exist |\n| `for` | for /f |\n| `lbl` | A label |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}